UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Gouffrefer Supplies',`Details`='Before the fighting began, we stored supplies for Dun\'Baldar in the Gouffrefer mine. The troggs that arrived were not a big problem as long as we had troops guarding the mine, but now that we are fighting the Horde, we can no longer hold it.$B$BWe need the supplies that are in Gouffrefer, $N. Go into the mine and bring back a load for us.',`Objectives`='Bring 10 Gouffrefer Supplies to the Alliance Quartermaster in Dun\'Baldar.'WHERE `entry` ='5892';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Frostreach Supplies',`Details`='The Frostreach mine to the north was once an ideal place to store supplies, but now that fighting against Frostwolf grows more violent, we no longer always have enough warriors to post there and keep it secure. Control of the mine often passes between the Alliance and its underground denizens...$B$BBut we are in dire need of our supplies, $N! Go to Frostreach Mine and bring back a load. And watch out for enemies along the way. The balance of power there can change very quickly...',`Objectives`='Bring 10 Frostreach Supplies to the Horde Quartermaster in the Frostwolf Hold.'WHERE `entry` ='5893';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='More Loot!',`Details`='I need more Armor Scraps, $N! Do you still have some?',`Objectives`='Thank you very much, $N. You make the Horde proud…'WHERE `entry` ='6741';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='More Armor Pieces!',`Details`='$N, we need more Armor Pieces to outfit our troops!',`Objectives`='These are good quality pieces, $N. I can use them to craft new equipment for our forces.$B$BIf my stock grows large enough, our veteran combat units will be able to use them on the battlefields!'WHERE `entry` ='6781';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Lokholar the Ice Lord',`Details`='I come from the Thundering Steppes, $R. Cairne himself ensured I would aid the Frostwolf clan in these troubled times.$B$BBut let us waste no time. You must slay our enemies and bring me their blood. When enough blood is gathered, the summoning ritual can begin.$B$BVictory will be assured when Lord Lokholar is unleashed upon the Frostwolf army.',`Objectives`='You must kill our enemies and bring me their blood.'WHERE `entry` ='6801';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Call of the Air - Guse\'s Squadron',`Details`='We must prepare the new squadron of war riders, $R! My riders are ready to launch an attack on the main battlefield, but first I must ready them for the assault.$B$BI need enough Stormpike soldier flesh to feed a fleet! You can surely handle that, can\'t you? Go!',`Objectives`='I need enough Stormpike soldier flesh to feed a fleet!'WHERE `entry` ='6825';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Call of the Air - Jeztor\'s Squadron',`Details`='You have worked hard, $N, but this is only a beginning! $B$BMy war riders must taste the flesh of their enemies. That will drive them to attack our enemies more precisely! $B$BMy squadron is the second strongest force in our air command. $N, they will face the most powerful of our foes. For that they need the flesh of Stormpike lieutenants.$B$BMove quickly, soldier!',`Objectives`='I need the flesh of Stormpike lieutenants.'WHERE `entry` ='6826';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Call of the Air - Mulverick\'s Squadron',`Details`='I was locked up in Dwarven for days. Believe me, I want my vengeance! $B$BWe must proceed carefully.$B$BFirst, my war riders need targets to strike — priority targets. I will need to feed them the flesh of Stormpike commanders. Unfortunately those bastards are entrenched behind enemy lines! You know your objective now.',`Objectives`='I need the flesh of Stormpike lieutenants.'WHERE `entry` ='6827';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Master Ryson\'s All-Seeing Eye',`Details`='Your war in the heart of Alterac means nothing to the Syndicate, $C. We will do as we always do: wait until a clear opportunity for victory emerges from the ashes and rubble, then strike.$B$BThat is not why we are here today, however. The All-Seeing Eye has been stolen by the Winterax trolls of the region.$B$BRetrieve the Eye and we will put ourselves at your service.$B$BReturn to me once the Eye is in your possession, and I will consider the matter.$B$B<Master Ryson smiles.>',`Objectives`='Retrieve Master Ryson\'s All-Seeing Eye from the Winterax Caves and return it to Master Ryson.$B$BBe aware that Master Ryson\'s All-Seeing Eye is said to contain a terrible curse! Retrieve Master Ryson\'s All-Seeing Eye!'WHERE `entry` ='6847';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Master Ryson\'s All-Seeing Eye',`Details`='Your war in the heart of Alterac means nothing to the Syndicate, $C. We will do as we always do: wait until a clear opportunity for victory emerges from the ashes and rubble, then strike.$B$BThat is not why we are here today, however. The All-Seeing Eye has been stolen by the Winterax trolls of the region.$B$BRetrieve the Eye and we will put ourselves at your service.$B$BReturn to me once the Eye is in your possession, and I will consider the matter.$B$B<Master Ryson smiles.>',`Objectives`='Retrieve Master Ryson\'s All-Seeing Eye from the Winterax Caves and return it to Master Ryson.$B$BBe aware that Master Ryson\'s All-Seeing Eye is said to contain a terrible curse! Retrieve Master Ryson\'s All-Seeing Eye!'WHERE `entry` ='6848';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Zinfizzlex\'s Portable Shredder',`Details`='I am eager to test my Portable Shredder, $N, but before I can assemble the kit I need a lot of materials!$B$BSpecifically, I need a mountain of thorium, mithril, and iron. I will also need a Mechanical Saw for each unit. You will find them at the sawmill.$B$BWhile I was loitering in the area (before my capture) I noticed a pile of Mechanical Saws at the Stormpike Lumber Camp.',`Objectives`='Master Engineer Zinfizzlex wants you to bring him the following materials:$B$B*30 Thorium Bars.$B$B*50 Mithril Bars.$B$B*75 Iron Bars.$B$B*1 Mechanical Saw.'WHERE `entry` ='6861';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Zinfizzlex\'s Portable Shredder',`Details`='I am eager to test my Portable Shredder, $N, but before I can assemble the kit I need a lot of materials!$B$BSpecifically, I need a mountain of thorium, mithril, and iron. I will also need a Mechanical Saw for each unit. You will find them at the sawmill.$B$BWhile I was loitering in the area (before my capture), I noticed a pile of Mechanical Saws at the Frostwolf Lumber Camp.',`Objectives`='Master Engineer Zinfizzlex wants you to bring him the following materials:$B$B*30 Thorium Bars.$B$B*50 Mithril Bars.$B$B*75 Iron Bars.$B$B*1 Mechanical Saw.'WHERE `entry` ='6862';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Ivus the Forest Lord',`Details`='The Frostwolf Clan is protected by an elemental energy. Their shaman wields powers that will surely destroy us if we allow it.$B$BThe damage has become too great for the Circle of Energy to absorb! Ivus must be called to aid us.$B$BThe Frostwolf soldiers wear elemental charms called Storm Crystals. We can use those charms to summon Ivus. Go and claim the crystals, $N!',`Objectives`='Frostwolf soldiers wear elemental charms called Storm Crystals. We can use these charms to summon Ivus. Go and claim the crystals, $N!'WHERE `entry` ='6881';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Launch the Attack!',`Details`='My warriors are eager to attack! The only thing I need to give the assault are those orders…',`Objectives`='Now is the time! We can show the Alliance it was madness to enter Alterac Valley!'WHERE `entry` ='6901';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Call of the Air - Vipore\'s Squadron',`Details`='You must deal with the elite units of Frostwolf who hold the lines, soldier! I charge you to remove this herd of savages. Return to me with the medals of their lieutenants and legionnaires; when I deem enough enemies slain I will commit the air strike.',`Objectives`='Return to me with the medals of lieutenants and legionnaires.'WHERE `entry` ='6941';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Call of the Air - Slidore\'s Squadron',`Details`='My gryphons are in place to make a frontal assault, but they cannot while the enemy ranks remain intact.$B$BThe Frostwolf warriors holding the front lines proudly wear medals on their chests. Rip those medals from their rotting corpses and bring them to me.$B$BOnce the enemy front-line numbers are sufficiently reduced, I will order the airstrike! Let death fall from the sky!',`Objectives`='Bring me back enough medals, soldier! The Gryphon squadron will be ready to strike in no time!'WHERE `entry` ='6942';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Call of the Air - Ichman\'s Squadron',`Details`='Their spirits are weak, soldier. After our last failed airstrike against the Horde, they refuse to fly! It is up to you to restore their morale.$B$BReturn to the battlefield and strike at the heart of Frostwolf command. Kill their commanders and guardians. Come back to me with as many of their medals as you can carry. I promise that when my gryphons smell the blood of our enemies, they will fly again! Now go!',`Objectives`='Kill their commanders or guardians and bring me their medals!'WHERE `entry` ='6943';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Frostreach Supplies',`Details`='Frostreach Mine is a Horde supply depot. I despise the food they feed their troops, and their weapons and armor are in terrible condition! But... in desperate times, when supplies matter most, such things can still be useful to us.$B$BEnter Frostreach Mine and bring me their supplies. This will help the Alliance keep fighting, and deprive Horde warriors of equipment they sorely need.$B$BGood luck, $N. The mine lies to the south, deep in Horde territory.',`Objectives`='Bring 10 Frostreach Supplies to the Alliance Quartermaster in Dun\'Baldar.'WHERE `entry` ='6982';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Gouffrefer Supplies',`Details`='The Stormpike dwarves use Gouffrefer Mine to store their reserves. Pillage it and bring me their supplies. This will slow their efforts in Alterac Valley and give us the equipment we need! $B$BBe careful, $N. Gouffrefer Mine lies deep in Alliance territory and has changed hands many times.',`Objectives`='Bring 10 Gouffrefer Supplies to the Horde Quartermaster in the Frostwolf Hold.'WHERE `entry` ='6985';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Empty Stables',`Details`='The war in the valley has cost our soldiers dearly. We must bolster our forces!$B$BIf we can fill the stables, our Wolf Riders can join the battle again.$B$BTake this muzzle and track the Icefang wolves that live in the nearby forest. When you find one, use the muzzle to tame it.$B$BWhen there are enough wolves in the Stable, the Wolf Riders will resume their patrols along our lines.',`Objectives`='Find an Icefang Wolf in Alterac Valley. Use the Icefang Wolf Muzzle to "tame" the beast. When tamed, the wolf will follow you to the Frostwolf Stable Master. Speak to the Frostwolf Stable Master to be credited for this capture. Wolf muzzled and delivered.'WHERE `entry` ='7001';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Ramskin Harness',`Details`='While some of our soldiers capture wolves for the Stable Master, others must prepare the necessities for riding. I speak of riding harnesses, of course.$B$BYou must kill the native rams of the region. The same rams that the Frostwolf cavalry use!$B$BKill them and return to me with their pelts. Once we gather enough hides, we will craft the harnesses for the cavalry. The Frostwolf wolf riders will ride again!',`Objectives`='Kill them and return to me with their pelts. The same rams used by the Frostwolf cavalry as mounts!'WHERE `entry` ='7002';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Ram Harnesses',`Details`='The Stormpike brigade cannot charge properly without harnesses! After all, we are not savages.$B$BWe could kill the rams near our base to make harnesses, but that would be foolish: we need them as mounts.$B$BYou must attack the enemy base, kill their war wolves and take their pelts. Bring them to me, and we will make harnesses for the cavalry. Go!',`Objectives`='Kill the war wolves and bring me their pelts.'WHERE `entry` ='7026';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Empty Stables',`Details`='Look at the stables, $N! Empty! The Stormpike brigade has no rams left to ride. Our cavalry is gone.$B$BYou must help us, soldier. Take this training collar and venture into the wild part of the valley. Find Alterac rams wandering there and use the collar to capture one. Once you have it, bring it here and I will put it in the Stable.$B$BWhen we have enough rams, I will inform the officer in charge. With your help, the cavalry will be reborn!',`Objectives`='Find an Alterac Ram in Alterac Valley. When nearby, use the Stormpike Training Collar to "tame" it. Once tamed, the Alterac Ram will follow you to the Stable Master. Speak to the Stable Master to be credited for this capture. Ram captured and delivered.'WHERE `entry` ='7027';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='The Graveyards of Alterac Valley',`Details`='The graveyards of Alterac Valley are prime territories. The Horde and Alliance fight fiercely to hold these consecrated grounds. Are you ready to join this fight, $N!$B$BI want you to capture an enemy graveyard. Find a graveyard flying the Horde banner and tear it down! If you succeed, the task I set will be complete!$B$BBut if you hold it for a few more minutes, our troops will come relieve you.',`Objectives`='Attack a graveyard, then report to Corporal Noreg Stormpike in Dun\'Baldar.'WHERE `entry` ='7081';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Alterac Graveyards',`Details`='In this valley, the front shifts constantly. Territories advance and retreat with the ebb and flow of battle. It so happens that graveyards are where the conflict is most intense, $N.$B$BTake a graveyard from the Alliance! Find a graveyard with an Alliance banner planted in its center and rip it up!$B$BIf you succeed, the task I set will be complete, but if you hold the graveyard for a few more minutes, it will become ours and our troops will relieve you.',`Objectives`='Attack a graveyard, then report to Corporal Teeka Bloodsnarl in the Alterac Mountains.'WHERE `entry` ='7082';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Towers and Keeps',`Details`='Towers and keeps are defensive positions of great value, and we must take them all. I want you to attack an enemy keep or tower.$B$BTo do this, enter a tower or keep flying an Alliance banner. Inside you will find another enemy banner. Take it, and the Horde banner will appear in its place. Well done!$B$BAt that point, your mission will be complete, but if you hold it long enough and the Alliance does not counterattack, the area will fall to us!',`Objectives`='Capture an enemy tower, then report to Corporal Teeka Bloodsnarl at Frostwolf Hold.'WHERE `entry` ='7101';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Towers and Keeps',`Details`='Towers and keeps are defensive positions of great value, and we must hold as many as possible. I want you to attack an enemy keep or tower.$B$BTo do this, enter a tower or keep flying a Horde banner. Inside you will find another enemy banner. Take it, and the Alliance banner will appear in its place. Well done!$B$BAt that point, your mission will be complete, but if you hold it long enough and the Horde does not counterattack, the area will fall to us!',`Objectives`='Destroy an enemy tower or keep banner, then report to Sergeant Durgen Stormpike in Dun\'Baldar.'WHERE `entry` ='7102';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='The Quartermaster',`Details`='$N, our Quartermaster has asked me to send him new recruits. He needs the supplies kept in caches hidden in the mines of Alterac, and he will likely send you to retrieve them.$B$BFollow the road. You will find the Quartermaster to the west.',`Objectives`='Speak to the Stormpike Quartermaster.'WHERE `entry` ='7121';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Take a Mine',`Details`='The mines of Alterac Valley hold more than ore. The Frostwolves and Stormpikes have hidden supplies in the Gouffrefer and Frostreach mines! It would not be a bad idea if we could hold one of them!$B$BTake a mine and then return to me. To take a mine, enter one that we do not currently control and kill its leader. When that is done, the mine will be ours and we will send troops to guard it!',`Objectives`='Take a mine not controlled by the Stormpikes, then report to the Stormpike Quartermaster in Dun\'Baldar.'WHERE `entry` ='7122';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Talk to our Quartermaster',`Details`='$N, the Frostwolf Quartermaster is looking for recruits to perform tasks that will lead them into the mines of Alterac Valley. Go talk to him; he will tell you more.$B$BFollow the road west to the fort and take the west exit; you will find our Quartermaster there.',`Objectives`='Speak to the Frostwolf Quartermaster.'WHERE `entry` ='7123';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Take a Mine',`Details`='The battle rages in the valley, but it also rages in the Gouffrefer and Frostreach mines. Both are rich in ore and used for storing supplies; it is no surprise they are highly valued!$B$BContribute to our war effort, $N! Capture a mine for the Horde! To do this, enter a mine we do not control and kill its leader. The mine will then be ours and we will send troops to defend it!',`Objectives`='Take a mine, then report to Corporal Teeka Bloodsnarl in the Alterac Mountains.'WHERE `entry` ='7124';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='The Battle for Alterac',`Details`='The Explorer\'s League suspects artifacts lie within Alterac Valley, but the Frostwolf orcs keep us from exploring it. We cannot allow the Horde to hinder the pursuit of knowledge! Kill Drek\'Thar, their general. Without him, the Frostwolves will lose their bite.$B$BDrek\'Thar is in Frostwolf Keep, to the south of Alterac Valley. Kill him and return to me.',`Objectives`='Enter Alterac Valley, kill Drek\'Thar, the general of the Horde, and then return to Prospector Stonehewer in the Alterac Mountains.'WHERE `entry` ='7141';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='The Battle for Alterac',`Details`='The Stormpike dwarves and their allies have invaded Alterac Valley, and we must drive them out!$B$BTo do this, we must defeat their general, Vanndar Stormpike.$B$BYou will find Vanndar in Dun\'Baldar, north of Alterac Valley. Kill him, $N, and return to me.',`Objectives`='Enter Alterac Valley, kill Vanndar Stormpike, the dwarven general, then return to Voggah Deathgrip in the Alterac Mountains.'WHERE `entry` ='7142';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Prove Your Worth',`Details`='Greetings, $C. It has been a long time since we answered the Call to Battle. The old desire is slow to rise, but when it wakes, blood runs hotter in our veins. The rage of battle returns!$B$BAll newcomers to the valley must perform the rite of battle.$B$BDeep within the gnoll Den of the Claw there is a Frostwolf banner. Go there and retrieve it. Bring it back to me and I will give you the Frostwolf Initiate Insignia.',`Objectives`='Travel to the Den of the Claw, southeast of the main base, retrieve the Frostwolf Banner there and return it to Warlord Laggrond.'WHERE `entry` ='7161';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Prove Your Worth',`Details`='You arrive just in time, $C. These Frostwolves refuse to yield! We must show them the might of the Stormpikes. Before you risk the battlefield you must join the ranks of the Stormpikes.$B$BThe Icewing caverns lie to the southwest. In their depths you will find a Stormpike banner. Go retrieve it and return it to me to earn the Stormpike Initiate Insignia.',`Objectives`='Travel to the Icewing caverns, southwest of the main base, retrieve the Stormpike Banner there and return it to Lieutenant Haggerdin.'WHERE `entry` ='7162';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Ascension and Recognition',`Details`='This is your time, $N. You have done much for the Frostwolf clan and in doing so you are not only in a position to become a Frostwolf soldier but also a friend. $B$BPerfect! Here is your Initiate Insignia.',`Objectives`='This new insignia reflects your rank among the Frostwolves. Keep it on you at all times.$B$BYou $C... Kill with honor!'WHERE `entry` ='7163';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Honored Among the Clan',`Details`='It is a pleasure to see you again, $C. I did not expect your return. $N, you have proven yourself a brave and honorable Frostwolf soldier. $B$BYour time has come again, $N. You have earned a new rank and, of course, new insignias showing your rise in status. $B$BPresent your insignias.',`Objectives`='*The Warlord Laggrond greets you.* $B$BCome on, $N! Continue defending the Frostwolf cause. This war must be won! For Drek\'Thar! For the Warchief!'WHERE `entry` ='7164';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Rank Up',`Details`='So much death. Blood soils the battlefields. Yet… You live… You have persevered. You have led our armies to many victories. For this, soldier, you have earned a new rank.$B$BYou are given your insignia.',`Objectives`='<Warlord Laggrond roars.>$B$BThey already speak of your exploits, soldier. The Stormpikes tremble at the mention of your name. Continue!'WHERE `entry` ='7165';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Hero of Legend',`Details`='You shine with mastery and power, $C. Glorified before the Frostwolves, the enemy trembles at the mere mention of your name.$B$BLong live, Hero of the Frostwolves. Long live and be honored! $B$BPresent your insignias.',`Objectives`='Soon, the entire battlefield will be under your watchful eye. The command of the valley and its troops will be yours!'WHERE `entry` ='7166';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='The Eye of Command',`Details`='Drek\'Thar sings your praises. Kalimdor rejoices, spreading the tale of your deeds. The Warlord is proud; your tenacious defense of our clan pleases him greatly. $B$BYou have earned the Eye of Command. $B$BYou are given your insignia, Commander $N.',`Objectives`='Use the power of your insignia. Let the enemy hear your voice. The Horde\'s might is unquestionable.'WHERE `entry` ='7167';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Ascension and Recognition',`Details`='Most people do not live long enough to rise above their own mediocrity. You have shown you are an exemplary soldier, $C. The time has come.$B$BHere is your insignia.',`Objectives`='Raise our enemies so our soldiers never drop their arms! Fight for the glory of the Stormpikes!'WHERE `entry` ='7168';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Honored Among the Guard',`Details`='The drums of war beat in distant lands, $C. The favored clan of your Warlord is being attacked by the abominable Stormpike Guard of Ironforge.$B$BFrom your looks, I can tell you are battle-hardened and ready to defend the Frostwolf cause.$B$BIt is now for you to decide your future.$B$BNorth of Tarren Mill, in Alterac, you will find the entrance to Alterac Valley. There you will find Warlord Laggrond. $N $C, for the coming battle!',`Objectives`='Venture into Alterac Valley, located in the Alterac Mountains. Find and speak with Warlord Laggrond, who stands at the tunnel entrance, to begin your career as a Frostwolf soldier. You will find the valley entrance north of Tarren Mill, at the base of the Alterac Mountains.'WHERE `entry` ='7169';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Rank Up',`Details`='I must know, $N. When you look directly into the eyes of the enemy, do you see fear? Do they now tremble in your presence? They must realize they are defeated! $B$BYou have earned to be revered among the guards.$B$BYou are given your insignia.',`Objectives`='When we first met, I would never have thought you would become a hero. Continue, soldier!'WHERE `entry` ='7170';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Hero of Legend',`Details`='<Lieutenant Haggerdin greets you.> $B$BFew have earned such a rank among the Stormpikes. I could imagine the defeat of the enemy through you. I have seen their hope collapse in your presence. When you enter action, you become a symbol of hope for our forces! $B$BPresent your insignias.',`Objectives`=''WHERE `entry` ='7171';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='The Eye of Command',`Details`='Let them hear your voice, Commander $N! Let them know fear. Show them what Stormpike power holds in their ranks! $B$BYou are given your insignia.',`Objectives`='You must lead our troops to victory, Commander! The soldiers are under your command. They will follow your orders. Lead them… Crush the Frostwolves.'WHERE `entry` ='7172';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='The Legend of Korrak',`Details`='The Stormpike invaders are not the only threat in the region, soldier. The war in the Valley is fought on two fronts. The cannibal Winterax trolls have their own ambitions.$B$BThey are led by Korrak the Ragefury, a cruel and cunning beast.$B$BKorrak\'s death would be a great blow to the Winterax. Kill this beast and you will be rewarded!',`Objectives`='Korrak the Ragefury hides in the depths of the Winterax Caves. Legend says the Winterax chief will only show himself after 500 of his warriors have died.$B$BTravel to the Winterax Caves and slaughter everything in your path until Korrak appears. Kill him and report to Warlord Laggrond.'WHERE `entry` ='7181';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Korrak the Ragefury',`Details`='The natives of the area, the Winterax trolls, are savage cannibals who dream of adding our bones to their infamous stews.$B$BWe must show them our strength! $B$BWe have recovered books in their caves that detail their hierarchy. They indicate that their leader, Korrak the Ragefury, tends to remain hidden until there is cause for him to make his presence known.$B$BKorrak\'s death would mean the end of the Winterax clan! Kill him and return to me.',`Objectives`='Korrak the Ragefury hides in the depths of the Winterax Caves. Legend says the chief will only reveal himself after 500 of his warriors have been killed.$B$BTravel to the Winterax Caves and slaughter everything in your path until Korrak appears. Kill him and report to Lieutenant Haggerdin.'WHERE `entry` ='7202';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Armor Pieces',`Details`='Fighting rages constantly in Alterac Valley, and the gear we receive from Ironforge is not enough to outfit our troops.$B$BIf you find Armor Pieces on the battlefield, contribute to the war effort and bring them to me!',`Objectives`='Bring 20 Armor Pieces to Murgot Deepforge in Dun\'Baldar.'WHERE `entry` ='7223';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Taken by the Enemy',`Details`='When you fight the enemy, gather the pieces of their armor and bring them to me. I will use them to craft armor for our own troops!',`Objectives`='Bring 20 Armor Pieces to Blacksmith Regzar at Frostwolf Hold.'WHERE `entry` ='7224';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Defense of the Frostwolves',`Details`='The drums of war echo in distant lands, $C. The favored clan of your Warlord is under attack by the infamous Stormpike Guard of Ironforge. $B$BYou look hardened and ready to fight for the clan\'s cause.$B$BIt is now up to you to take this step in your advancement.$B$BYou will find the entrance to the valley in the foothills of Hillsbrad. Enter it and find Warlord Laggrond. Hurry, $C, the battle has begun!',`Objectives`='Report to Alterac Valley, in the foothills of Hillsbrad. Find Warlord Laggrond, speak to him, and begin your career as a Frostwolf soldier.'WHERE `entry` ='7241';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Sovereign Imperative',`Details`='We wage a brutal battle in the Alterac valleys. The cannibal Winterax trolls attack us on one side, the fierce Frostwolf clan on the other. Both must be exterminated in the name of King Magni Bronzebeard! This land must be taken and cleansed. It is a sovereign territorial imperative for the kingdom of Ironforge!$B$BAlas, soldiers do not grow on trees! Report to Lieutenant Haggerdin in Alterac Valley to begin your career as a Stormpike soldier.',`Objectives`='Report to Alterac Valley, in the foothills of Hillsbrad. Report to Lieutenant Haggerdin.$B$BFor the glory of Bronzebeard!'WHERE `entry` ='7261';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Brotherly Love',`Details`='Tragic! My brother and I are on opposite sides: he is a commander among the Stormpikes.$B$BOf the four Stormpike commanders, he is by far the most dangerous. Perhaps if he were killed, the Queen could show him his error, as she did with me!$B$BYou will find my brother deep in enemy territory. Kill him and bring him to me. I trust you to complete this mission, soldier.$B$BOh! And do not go alone.',`Objectives`='Penetrate Stormpike territory and kill Commander Karl Philips. When done, report to Commander Louis Philips.'WHERE `entry` ='7281';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Brotherly Love',`Details`='It is necessary to end his suffering, soldier. He does not know what he is doing. He has become a mindless servant of the terrible Banshee Queen.$B$BCross the Bleeding Fields and penetrate deep into Frostwolf territory. Find my brother and destroy him. His torment must end.',`Objectives`='Penetrate Frostwolf territory and kill Commander Louis Philips. When done, report to Commander Karl Philips.'WHERE `entry` ='7282';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Broken Wings',`Details`='We have them, $R. I speak of their squadron leaders. The aerial battle was fierce, but they have fallen. Unfortunately, our best pilots were shot down in a counterattack over Frostwolf Keep. You must find out what happened to them.$B$BGo to the West Watch Tower and Frostwolf Keep — those were their last known positions. Search the surroundings thoroughly.',`Objectives`='Venture into Frostwolf territory in search of squadron leaders Slidor, Vipore, and Ichman. When you find them, report to Commander Duffy.'WHERE `entry` ='7301';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Broken Wings',`Details`='Our air support is gone, $N. Our squadron leaders were shot down over enemy territory. You must discover what happened to them so we can mount a rescue! Guse was last seen above the Icewing Keep. Jeztor was seen near the Stormpike Lumber Camp. As for Mulverick — that reckless fool was seen crashing near the northern keep of Dun\'Baldar.$B$BI have no further information. Go and search the area thoroughly!',`Objectives`='Discover what happened to squadron leaders Guse, Jeztor, and Mulverick. When found, report to Commander Mulfort.'WHERE `entry` ='7302';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='In Favor with the Darkspear',`Details`='Before the night elves, there were trolls. The night elves came from the trolls.$B$BTheir undisciplined attacks on my people are intolerable. Staghelm seeks to eradicate us, to erase all trace of those who birthed him and his kind. This will not happen!$B$BFor every night elf you kill and decapitate, Najak will grant you favor among the Darkspear. Tales of your deeds will spread across Kalimdor and the Eastern Kingdoms. Go and serve the Darkspear!',`Objectives`='You are tasked with killing night elf NPCs present in Alterac Valley.$B$BKill a night elf and present a Night Elf Head to Najak Maleficas.'WHERE `entry` ='7361';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Ally of the Tauren',`Details`='The Ancestral sends me to this war zone to study other peoples. I am here to collect gnome samples. Magatha is interested in their survival potential. Gnomes are small and ridiculously weak, but they show remarkable resilience, in combat or otherwise.$B$BFortunately for you, I seek strong specimens to do Magatha\'s bidding. Bring me gnome tufts of hair and the taurens will consider you an ally.',`Objectives`='You are tasked with killing gnome NPCs present in Alterac Valley.$B$BKill a gnome and present a Gnome Tuft of Hair to Ravak Grimtotem at Frostwolf Keep.'WHERE `entry` ='7362';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='The Human Condition',`Details`='Humans are detestable.$B$BI am a Frostwolf soldier, but I serve Sylvanas.$B$BI take this service as an opportunity to assist the Apothecaries of the Sepulcher.$B$BI have begun collecting bits of bone that might be used to heal the human condition.$B$BI am allowed to subcontract this task to my subordinates.$B$BFind them. Kill them. Bring back bone fragments.',`Objectives`='You are tasked with killing human NPCs present in Alterac Valley.$B$BKill a human and present a Human Bone to Commander Louis Philips (who travels between the front and Frostwolf Keep).$B$BA remedy for the human condition is at hand!'WHERE `entry` ='7363';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='In Service to Gnomeregan',`Details`='The Tinkerer himself sends me to this battlefield to defend my gnome brothers and sisters. We have heard the taurens are attacking gnomes and, worse, tearing handfuls of hair from the bodies of the fallen. This must end. We will retaliate!$B$BRelieve them of their hooves, $C. Bring me their hooves! Show you are an ally of the gnomes.',`Objectives`='You are tasked with killing tauren NPCs present in Alterac Valley.$B$BKill a tauren and present a Tauren Hoof to Dirk Roughback in Dun\'Balar.'WHERE `entry` ='7364';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Staghelm\'s Mojo Collection',`Details`='Staghelm will not be satisfied until all the trolls are... silenced. Keep collecting mojo from their hideous carcasses…',`Objectives`='You have the favor of the night elves of Darnassus, but much work remains.'WHERE `entry` ='7425';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='A Man\'s Love',`Details`='<Commander Philips seems to weep.>$B$BSuch kindness in most humans is beyond their capacity. Benedictus is a living miracle!$B$BContinue spreading that kindness, $N. There are so many putrid hearts left to incinerate! Do not let him down.',`Objectives`='Bring Putrid Hearts to Commander Philips.'WHERE `entry` ='7426';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Wanted: MORE DWARVES!',`Details`='When I have enough spines, I will load them onto one of our catapults and fling them at Dun Baldar.$B$BThe Stormpikes will be covered in filth and chunks of flesh. I can hardly wait.$B$BWe will need more spines.',`Objectives`='I know I said you would never forget your first spine toss, but I forgot to add you will not forget the next 500. Get to work!'WHERE `entry` ='7427';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Wanted: MORE ORCS!',`Details`='These savages will never understand, $N. Keep slaughtering orcs without mercy. The Frostwolves will learn their pain and the gnomes will stop losing hair.$B$BThe watchword is "victory victory".',`Objectives`='Bring more Orc Teeth to Corporal Noreg Stormpike in Dun\'Baldar.'WHERE `entry` ='7428';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Hero of the Frostwolves',`Details`='<You will be given a quest that will simply ask you to choose an item after completing the Battle for Alterac>',`Objectives`=''WHERE `entry` ='8272';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Invaders of Alterac Valley',`Details`='Listen, $N. Despite everything you may have heard about the raging battle in Alterac Valley, one thing remains true! The Stormpike expedition has invaded Frostwolf territory! The day we allow the Alliance to invade Horde lands without a decisive response is the day I hang up my axe and spend the rest of my life in shame. Go fight and drive out the invaders!',`Objectives`='Bring 3 Alterac Valley Marks of Honor to one of the Horde warleaders at the battlefield.'WHERE `entry` ='8369';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Let the Assault Begin!',`Details`='My troops are equipped and ready for the assault. We only need Noreg Stormpike\'s orders and I will send them into the fray!',`Objectives`='Obtain the Stormpike assault orders from Corporal Noreg Stormpike and bring them to Field Marshal Teravaine.'WHERE `entry` ='6846';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Staghelm\'s Requiem',`Details`='Staghelm has given the order. All trolls on the battlefield must be exterminated. Their ridiculous claim to have given birth to the night elves deserves only one response: force.$B$BKill them and bring me their mojo. I repeat! I want you to steal their mojo.',`Objectives`='You have been charged with killing troll NPCs in Alterac Valley.$B$BKill a troll and report to Athramanis at Dun\'Baldar with a Darkspear Troll Mojo.'WHERE `entry` ='7365';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='The Archbishop\'s Mercy',`Details`='The Archbishop is as good as he is wise. It takes someone exceptional to have mercy on such wretches!$B$BHe is too good! Too good.$B$BThe Archbishop insists that we show mercy to the undead. We must grant them a quick and merciful death. To do this, we need their black, diseased hearts.$B$BBring me the hearts of the Forsaken so we can incinerate them in the Cathedral of Light in a grand ceremony. Hurry, $N!',`Objectives`='You have been charged with killing Forsaken NPCs in Alterac Valley.$B$BKill a Forsaken and report to Commander Karl Philips (who shuttles between the sawmill and the mine) with a Forsaken Heart.'WHERE `entry` ='7366';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Disarming the Mines',`Details`='The Frostwolves have booby-trapped their lines and bases, $C. When you enter their territory, you must be careful where you step.$B$BIf you launch a major strike against them, you must destroy their anti-personnel explosives expert. By killing him, you can disarm the mines safely. As long as he is alive, the mines remain harmless to us.$B$BYou will probably find him in a tower near the Glacesong garrison. Good luck!',`Objectives`='Find the Frostwolf explosives expert and kill him. Once done, report to the Stormpike explosives expert.'WHERE `entry` ='7367';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Disarming the Mines',`Details`='I know all about mines. I am the one who lays them on the front lines, after all.$B$BIf you want to neutralize the Stormpike minefields, all you have to do is kill their explosives expert. That cowardly dwarf is probably hiding in the first tower of the Bloodfield. Get rid of him and these mines will be safe after being disarmed.$B$BIf you manage to kill him, come back here and let me know. After all, it is good to reward good deeds.',`Objectives`='Find the Stormpike explosives expert and kill him. Once done, report to the Frostwolf explosives expert.'WHERE `entry` ='7368';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='The Return of Korrak',`Details`='Korrak has been killed, yes, but one question remains! Will he stay dead? Trolls are known for their strange tribal sorcery. I would not be surprised if their dead chief were to rise again to take command of his clan.$B$BYou know what to do if that happens.$B$BAnd this time, I want his head. Keep your eyes open, soldier.$B$BYou are dismissed!',`Objectives`='If Korrak the Ragefury returns in the Winterax Caves of Alterac Valley, seek him out and kill him.$B$BBring Korrak\'s Skull to Warlord Laggrond at Frostwolf Keep.'WHERE `entry` ='7381';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Korrak the Indestructible',`Details`='Something is wrong here? Did someone think to burn Korrak\'s body? These trolls will do anything to resurrect their chief. That is common practice among these blue-skinned, semi-human pagans.$B$BKeep your eyes open, $N. Do not panic if Korrak reappears. If so, I want him dead and incinerated.$B$BAnd to be safe, before lighting the fire, cut off his head and bring it to me.',`Objectives`='If Korrak the Ragefury returns in the Winterax Caves of Alterac Valley, seek him out and kill him.$B$BBring Korrak\'s Skull to Lieutenant Haggerdin at Dun\'Baldar.'WHERE `entry` ='7382';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='A Few Litres of Blood',`Details`='You have the option of offering larger quantities of blood taken from our enemies. I would be happy to accept enormous amounts, $N.',`Objectives`='You must kill our enemies and bring me their blood.'WHERE `entry` ='7385';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Wanted: DWARVES!',`Details`='By order of Sergeant Yazra Bloodsnarl, all dwarves encountered on the battlefield must be killed on sight.$B$BIf you kill one, tear out its spinal column and leave the rest to rot! This pile of soft waste will serve as a warning to all who dare oppose the power of the Frostwolves.$B$BGo see Sergeant Yazzra Bloodsnarl with proof of your deeds.',`Objectives`='You have been charged with killing dwarf NPCs present in Alterac Valley.$B$BKill a dwarf and rip out its spinal column. Bring the Dwarf Spine to Sergeant Yazzra Bloodsnarl at Frostwolf Keep.'WHERE `entry` ='7401';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Wanted: ORCS!',`Details`='By order of Corporal Noreg Stormpike, all able-bodied soldiers must slay without mercy all orcs they encounter on the battlefield.$B$BThe soldiers must take a tusk or a tooth from the jaw of their victims and present the tooth as proof of their deed.$B$BThick gloves are recommended.',`Objectives`='You have been charged with killing orc NPCs present in Alterac Valley.$B$BKill an orc and deliver the Orc Teeth to Corporal Noreg Stormpike in Dun\'Baldar.'WHERE `entry` ='7402';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Defense of the Darkspear',`Details`='Continue the defense of the Darkspear, $N. Kill them all and bring their heads to Najak.',`Objectives`='Bring decapitated Night Elf heads to Najak.'WHERE `entry` ='7421';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='For a Handful of Hair',`Details`='It seems the Tinkerer has heard of our participation in Alterac Valley. He has tasked his own people with the extermination of the tauren as revenge. These gnomes are more diabolical than I first thought. More studies must be done! We will need more handfuls of hair.',`Objectives`='<Ravak sniffs the handful of gnome hair and breathes deeply.>$B$BWhat a bouquet. Gnome, male, young adult, a little stale. Am I right?'WHERE `entry` ='7422';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='More Bone Fragments!',`Details`='You are doing good work for these humans, $N. Continue to spread your healing touch to these races less fortunate than ours.$B$BEach human bone fragment is another potential soul saved from an existence shared with this disgusting scum.',`Objectives`='You are one of the champions of our people, $N. Continue!'WHERE `entry` ='7423';
UPDATE `quest_properties` SET `Title`='Hoof Hunt!',`Details`='Give them a lesson, $N. They must know the gnome people will not be insulted!',`Objectives`='*Dirk throws the hoof into a pile behind him.*'WHERE `entry` ='7424';

INSERT INTO `world_db_version` (`id`, `LastUpdate`) VALUES ('198', '20261018-00_quest_properties');
